          Improved KLIC with Optimized Goal Scheduling Ver2.10
            Kazuhiko Ohno and Masahiko Ikawa (Kyoto Univ.)
                                  1997.6.20

          Copyright (C) 1996-1997  Kazuhiko Ohno, Masahiko Ikawa,
